{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The genius Dr. Mememe, who wants to sleep all the time, invented Kawaii Sheep, which induces sleep with its mysterious healing properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When he woke up from his slumber, he found that the sheep he had invented last night were playing around the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201dWait, ...... if we let the healing sheep out, everyone will be healed too.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the story of Hakase putting the world to sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Game Flow\u3011</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player controls a Mememe. Grab the sheep and carry them to the balcony.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/sheep_en_1.gif?t=1745402175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sheep fly fluffy into the sky and score points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The points earned can be used to invent and enhance sheep production facilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/sheep_en_2.gif?t=1745402175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reduce sheep generation time and enhance Mememe with running machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expanded reproduction and mini-automation elements through invention and enhancement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/sheep_en_3.gif?t=1745402175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Generation of a combined sheep with a sheep compressor. A dog robot that chases away sheep. Various inventions appear.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3386670?t=1745402175","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3386670?t=1745402175","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/b02d981b62ed4c0a27b3fe7ed0f307c100ab2b8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745402175","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/b02d981b62ed4c0a27b3fe7ed0f307c100ab2b8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745402175","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The genius Dr. Mememe, who wants to sleep all the time, invented Kawaii Sheep, which induces sleep with its mysterious healing properties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When he woke up from his slumber, he found that the sheep he had invented last night were playing around the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201dWait, ...... if we let the healing sheep out, everyone will be healed too.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the story of Hakase putting the world to sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3010Game Flow\u3011</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The player controls a Mememe. Grab the sheep and carry them to the balcony.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/sheep_en_1.gif?t=1745402175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sheep fly fluffy into the sky and score points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The points earned can be used to invent and enhance sheep production facilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/sheep_en_2.gif?t=1745402175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reduce sheep generation time and enhance Mememe with running machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expanded reproduction and mini-automation elements through invention and enhancement.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/extras/sheep_en_3.gif?t=1745402175\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Generation of a combined sheep with a sheep compressor. A dog robot that chases away sheep. Various inventions appear.</p>","developers":["LabyLab"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3386670/b76bed2754260030c224ba73a84aada5ed509c02/header.jpg?t=1745402175","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 Catalina+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple \u30b7\u30ea\u30b3\u30f3 \u307e\u305f\u306f\u30a4\u30f3\u30c6\u30ebCore<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> </li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15 Catalina+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple \u30b7\u30ea\u30b3\u30f3 \u307e\u305f\u306f\u30a4\u30f3\u30c6\u30ebCore<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> </li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257111629,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111629/movie480.mp4?t=1741749788","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111629/movie_max.mp4?t=1741749788"},"name":"1st-Trailer(JP)","thumbn